{"server":"tw","storyId":"act29side_level_act29side_03_end","groupId":"act29side","stageId":"act29side_03","title":"練習曲“奇遇”","storyCode":"ZT-3","avgTag":"行動後","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/tw/gamedata/story/activities/act29side/level_act29side_03_end.txt","sourceHash":"abb4733c81380ea0c11df8dd7bff98f8c857ac40f6c4088a5a55ac7d516050c8","bodyAvailable":true,"summaryText":"費德里科發現阿爾圖羅可能正躲藏在學校。薇薇安娜在畫家遺留的草稿上發現巫王殘黨的下一個目標可能是一位學者。同一時刻，這位學者打斷了針對黑鍵的法術儀式。","blocks":[{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_ltroom"},{"type":"narration","text":"彼得·盧卡斯男爵今年七十三歲。\n三年前他從伯父那裡繼承了爵位。盧卡斯家祖傳的高塔維修費用實在高昂，他不得不在半年後搬了家。\n他很喜歡卡爾·施密特的音樂，但很討厭如今這條同名街道。\n陽光，花香，年輕人的塗鴉，還有不遠處酒吧裡傳來的爵士樂都讓他難以忍受。\n他讓侍從拉上了窗簾，打開源石留聲機。房間裡立刻響起了大提琴聲。\n那個薩科塔真的很有音樂天分，他想。他決定原諒她是個拉特蘭人。\n他自己會演奏十一種樂器，其中十種都是在巫王時代學會的。\n為了把最好的旋律送進巫王的始源之塔，有天賦的年輕人被關在一起，沒日沒夜地創作。\n他最愛其中的小提琴手，愛她纖細的手指和掌緣的痣。\n當他第一次出訪維多利亞，在皇家劇院的舞台上，聽到一首又一首出自家鄉的樂曲響起，他流下了眼淚，第一次親吻了她。\n這就是優雅、雋永的萊塔尼亞啊。\n他真的很懷念它。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"44_g1_marigold"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"金律法衛","speakerId":"avg_npc_1117_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"金律法衛","speakerId":"avg_npc_1117_1","isRemote":false,"text":"故意摧毀民居，想藉機逃出去？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"金律法衛","speakerId":"avg_npc_1117_1","isRemote":false,"text":"在黃金旋律面前，你們的卑劣無處藏身。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“巫王的餘音”","speakerId":"avg_npc_1128_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呃——唔！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"金律法衛","speakerId":"avg_npc_1117_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你是最後一個。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"金律法衛","speakerId":"avg_npc_1117_1","isRemote":false,"text":"摘下面具，向萊塔尼亞的意志投降。這樣你就不必再忍受靈魂的灼痛。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“巫王的餘音”","speakerId":"avg_npc_1128_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這份灼痛……太過微小。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“巫王的餘音”","speakerId":"avg_npc_1128_1","isRemote":false,"text":"金律法衛閣下，您可曾聽過屬於巫王的皇家樂團的演奏？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“巫王的餘音”","speakerId":"avg_npc_1128_1","isRemote":false,"text":"恩瓦德的黑森林，福特岡的湖泊與港口，施彤領的風暴……您能想像到的關於萊塔尼亞的一切，都能在旋律中感受到。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“巫王的餘音”","speakerId":"avg_npc_1128_1","isRemote":false,"text":"巫王並不演繹，也從不指揮。他只漫步於其中。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“巫王的餘音”","speakerId":"avg_npc_1128_1","isRemote":false,"text":"作為他的樂手，你不得不依據他視線的指引，緊隨著他的步伐前行。一旦掉隊，你就會……被壯美的旋律撕裂。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"金律法衛","speakerId":"avg_npc_1117_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這是巫王最常用的刑罰，用以懲處那些不配在他身邊侍奉的弱者。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“巫王的餘音”","speakerId":"avg_npc_1128_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但我跟上過。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“巫王的餘音”","speakerId":"avg_npc_1128_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我成了那超越想像的旋律的一部分。在那之後，我已無法容忍再為任何庸人演奏。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"金律法衛","speakerId":"avg_npc_1117_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你們把自己當作什麼？偉大旋律的演繹者，心懷理想的顛覆者？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"金律法衛","speakerId":"avg_npc_1117_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"金律法衛","speakerId":"avg_npc_1117_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我看到的只有一群躲藏在面具後面，戕害無辜萊塔尼亞人性命、破壞和諧秩序的罪人……以及無能的、將頭埋在巫王餘燼中的小丑。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"金律法衛","speakerId":"avg_npc_1117_1","isRemote":false,"text":"黃金旋律會取走你們的性命。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"金律法衛","speakerId":"avg_npc_1117_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但是，在放棄自我、成為巫王附庸的那一刻，你們就已經與死人無異。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“巫王的餘音”","speakerId":"avg_npc_1128_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呃啊……哈……哈哈！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“巫王的餘音”","speakerId":"avg_npc_1128_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那您呢，閣下？別忘了，您也戴著面具。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“巫王的餘音”","speakerId":"avg_npc_1128_1","isRemote":false,"text":"您使用的源石技藝，這被一代又一代金律法衛傳承下來的法術——黃金旋律，萊塔尼亞的輝光，守衛金律樂章的力量——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“巫王的餘音”","speakerId":"avg_npc_1128_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不也是……某段出自更偉大的意志之手的，旋律的附庸？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"金律法衛","speakerId":"avg_npc_1117_1","isRemote":false,"text":"再偉大的個體意志，都無法與萊塔尼亞本身相提並論。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“巫王的餘音”","speakerId":"avg_npc_1128_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那此時此刻……宣判我的死亡的……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“巫王的餘音”","speakerId":"avg_npc_1128_1","isRemote":false,"text":"究竟是萊塔尼亞的黃金旋律，還是您自己？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"金律法衛","speakerId":"avg_npc_1117_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這是你找的後路嗎？難道你認為，這些蒼白的舊調，當真能撼動金律法衛的意志？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"金律法衛","speakerId":"avg_npc_1117_1","isRemote":false,"text":"荒謬。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“巫王的餘音”","speakerId":"avg_npc_1128_1","isRemote":false,"text":"為什麼……要找後路？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“巫王的餘音”","speakerId":"avg_npc_1128_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我本就是……被選中過來見您的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“巫王的餘音”","speakerId":"avg_npc_1128_1","isRemote":false,"text":"“首席”想讓我問問您……就在剛才，二十三年前的往事在您耳畔奏響……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“巫王的餘音”","speakerId":"avg_npc_1128_1","isRemote":false,"text":"您看到……身受致命傷，卻等不到您支援的恩斯特·霍赫貝格……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“巫王的餘音”","speakerId":"avg_npc_1128_1","isRemote":false,"text":"還有他那被迫當上選帝侯，鬱鬱而終的弟弟沃爾納了嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"金律法衛","speakerId":"avg_npc_1117_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"巫王殘黨的身軀在雙重源石技藝的作用下崩解成飛灰。\n和最後一縷煙塵一起撲向金律法衛的，還有他喑啞的遺言。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_ltroom"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薇薇安娜","speakerId":"avg_4098_vvana_1","isRemote":false,"text":"二十三年前，父親沒有等到母親。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"珂拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_1113_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他們彼此錯過了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"珂拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_1113_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那天上午，露辛達來到畫室之前，先去了香料市場。她好幾天沒什麼精神，想換種香薰提提神。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"珂拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_1113_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那時候她還不知道，自己和愛人有了一個孩子。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薇薇安娜","speakerId":"avg_4098_vvana_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薇薇安娜","speakerId":"avg_4098_vvana_1","isRemote":false,"text":"後來，母親還是去了施彤領。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"珂拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_1113_1","isRemote":false,"text":"她很愛你，也愛沃爾納。而且，留在崔林特爾梅的話，她一個人照顧不了你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"珂拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_1113_1","isRemote":false,"text":"她知道那時候的沃爾納已另娶他人，可她別無選擇。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薇薇安娜","speakerId":"avg_4098_vvana_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但父親原本還有機會。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"珂拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_1113_1","isRemote":false,"text":"十分鐘。要是沃爾納再多停留十分鐘，他就能見到露辛達。他會得知，她願意與他一起面對，一起抗爭。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"珂拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_1113_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這十分鐘……成了沃爾納一生的遺憾。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薇薇安娜","speakerId":"avg_4098_vvana_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我明白。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薇薇安娜","speakerId":"avg_4098_vvana_1","isRemote":false,"text":"父親從未對我提起過，但我都明白。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薇薇安娜","speakerId":"avg_4098_vvana_1","isRemote":false,"text":"金盞花，和月亮……本就沒有關聯。這只是一個夢，一個醒著的人聊以安慰自己的、遙不可及的理想。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"珂拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_1113_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你……不怪你父親嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薇薇安娜","speakerId":"avg_4098_vvana_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我不能。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薇薇安娜","speakerId":"avg_4098_vvana_1","isRemote":false,"text":"因為我和他，是那般相像。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薇薇安娜","speakerId":"avg_4098_vvana_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你們都告訴我，父親曾經夢想成為一名詩人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薇薇安娜","speakerId":"avg_4098_vvana_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但他從未在我面前唸過一首詩歌。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薇薇安娜","speakerId":"avg_4098_vvana_1","isRemote":false,"text":"回到萊塔尼亞之後……我才理解。當一個人已無力面對現實時，那些曾帶來過希望的意象，都會反過來刺痛他。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"珂拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_1113_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……薇薇安娜。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"珂拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_1113_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你父親走後，從施彤領到崔林特爾梅，你一直在忙碌。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"珂拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_1113_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我想讓你知道……你是可以表現出悲傷的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薇薇安娜","speakerId":"avg_4098_vvana_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薇薇安娜","speakerId":"avg_4098_vvana_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我想再休息一會。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薇薇安娜","speakerId":"avg_4098_vvana_1","isRemote":false,"text":"一下就好。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"珂拉沒有再說什麼。在離去之前，她拉上了窗簾。\n黑暗如同一床熟悉的被子，包裹住了薇薇安娜。珂拉是那樣瞭解她，知道什麼環境最讓她感到安心。\n她注視著房間裡一幅又一幅掩埋在陰影中的畫，畫中本該金燦燦的時光也注視著她。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"44_g5_spiralstairs"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"珂拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_1113_1","isRemote":false,"text":"幸好，琴聲中的源石技藝沒有對薇薇安娜造成什麼實質傷害。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"珂拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_1113_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但她和我們一樣，想起了與沃爾納相關的往事。她一定比我們更不好受。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"金律法衛","speakerId":"avg_npc_1117_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你受傷了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"珂拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_1113_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"珂拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_1113_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啊……不是戰鬥導致的。可能是在下樓追趕薇薇安娜的時候，撞傷了吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"金律法衛","speakerId":"avg_npc_1117_1","isRemote":false,"text":"為什麼不試一下我從哥倫比亞帶回來的康復儀？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"珂拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_1113_1","isRemote":false,"text":"布蘭特，我的眼睛不是昨天才剛受傷的。這二十多年跌跌撞撞的，不也一樣過來了嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"珂拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_1113_1","isRemote":false,"text":"倒是你……聲音有點奇怪。剛剛那些敵人，很難對付？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"金律法衛","speakerId":"avg_npc_1117_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可能嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"珂拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_1113_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這語氣才更像你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"珂拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_1113_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不過，你呀……真希望你偶爾也能摘下頭盔，喘口氣。就算是最厲害的樂器，一直持續不斷地投入使用的話，也會有損耗的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"金律法衛","speakerId":"avg_npc_1117_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我沒有休息的資格。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"金律法衛","speakerId":"avg_npc_1117_1","isRemote":false,"text":"憲兵隊正在趕來這裡的路上。他們會處理現場，幫助傷亡的民眾。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"金律法衛","speakerId":"avg_npc_1117_1","isRemote":false,"text":"在他們封鎖街道之前，儘快離開。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"珂拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_1113_1","isRemote":false,"text":"現在嗎？可我們正在接近真相。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"金律法衛","speakerId":"avg_npc_1117_1","isRemote":false,"text":"一個視力受損的調音師，一個退役的競技騎士……萊塔尼亞的未來還不至於要託付到你們手裡。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"珂拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_1113_1","isRemote":false,"text":"殘黨們正在尋找巫王的遺產。弗里達和洛里斯都是那一夜的目擊者。沃爾納…… 霍赫貝格家族也參與了那場政變。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"珂拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_1113_1","isRemote":false,"text":"假如他們想透過殺死目擊者來完成某種儀式的話，他們一定會去尋找下一個目標。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"金律法衛","speakerId":"avg_npc_1117_1","isRemote":false,"text":"所以，聽我的話，停止調查。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"珂拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_1113_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"珂拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_1113_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那你呢，布蘭特？要說政變當天也在現場的話，你明明也……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"金律法衛","speakerId":"avg_npc_1117_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我是萊塔尼亞意志的捍衛者。巫王殘黨還奈何不了我。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"金律法衛","speakerId":"avg_npc_1117_1","isRemote":false,"text":"更何況，他們在這條巷子裡設下埋伏，顯然已將你們視作目標。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"珂拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_1113_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他們為何覺得我們一定會來？難道薇薇安娜的猜測是真的，弗里達的畫裡還藏著至關重要的線索？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薇薇安娜","speakerId":"avg_4098_vvana_1","isRemote":false,"text":"恐怕是的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薇薇安娜","speakerId":"avg_4098_vvana_1","isRemote":false,"text":"布蘭特閣下，請允許我繼續調查。我想，我知道希曼夫人留下了什麼。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"金律法衛","speakerId":"avg_npc_1117_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你手裡的是……弗里達最後一幅作品的草稿。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薇薇安娜","speakerId":"avg_4098_vvana_1","isRemote":false,"text":"“遺憾”。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薇薇安娜","speakerId":"avg_4098_vvana_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這是畫家這一生最強烈的情感，也是最深的渴望。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薇薇安娜","speakerId":"avg_4098_vvana_1","isRemote":false,"text":"在生命的最後，她一遍又一遍地畫著這幅畫。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薇薇安娜","speakerId":"avg_4098_vvana_1","isRemote":false,"text":"只是因為，她想透過自己的畫筆，再一次見到心中的神明。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"金律法衛","speakerId":"avg_npc_1117_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這些亂糟糟的筆觸並非隨機塗抹？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薇薇安娜","speakerId":"avg_4098_vvana_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯。畫面看起來淩亂，是因為她在同一張紙上畫了太多遍。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薇薇安娜","speakerId":"avg_4098_vvana_1","isRemote":false,"text":"巫王死去時的那一幕，依然藏在草稿之中。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"珂拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_1113_1","isRemote":false,"text":"薇薇安娜，把畫放在地上。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薇薇安娜","speakerId":"avg_4098_vvana_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"珂拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_1113_1","isRemote":false,"text":"布蘭特，試著“演奏”畫幅。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"金律法衛","speakerId":"avg_npc_1117_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你說停的時候，我會停下。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薇薇安娜","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"畫幅在振動，就像樂器一樣。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"珂拉","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"……嗯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"珂拉","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"每一遍繪製，弗里達使用的顏料都有細微的差別。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"珂拉","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我看不見，但我的源石技藝，能夠讓我“聽”到每一層顏料的頻率。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"珂拉","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"快了……只要剝離上層的源石顏料，就能找到……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薇薇安娜","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"最初的畫面。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"珂拉","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你們看見了嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薇薇安娜","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"不是很清楚，但能看到高塔內部。很……壯觀。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"珂拉","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"……巫王塔。我想，就算是弗里達，也只能畫出很小的一部分。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"珂拉","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"能不能辨認畫上的人？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薇薇安娜","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"沒有巫王。王座面前是空著的，戰鬥似乎已經結束。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薇薇安娜","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"躲在帷幔後面的，是弗里達·希曼，畫家自己。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薇薇安娜","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"有士兵正從外面走廊上衝進來，那是一個黎博利……洛里斯·博爾丁？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薇薇安娜","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"還有……唔……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薇薇安娜","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"這個正在清理殘骸的，拿著施術單元的卡普里尼是誰？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"金律法衛","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"格哈德·霍夫曼。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"金律法衛","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"他是整個恩瓦德最具天賦的術師之一，曾經服務於烏提卡家族。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"金律法衛","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"在巫王死後，他成了一名老師。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"44_g1_marigold"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"米夏","speakerId":"avg_4109_baslin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我們來晚了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"米夏","speakerId":"avg_4109_baslin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這幫亡命之徒，根本不在意普通人的性命……真的該死。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"貴族侍從","speakerId":"avg_npc_496_1","isRemote":false,"text":"咳咳咳……咳咳！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"費德里科","speakerId":"avg_1032_excu2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你受傷了。請讓我幫你止血。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"貴族侍從","speakerId":"avg_npc_496_1","isRemote":false,"text":"謝謝。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"費德里科","speakerId":"avg_1032_excu2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"樓上就是盧卡斯男爵的住處。他情況怎麼樣？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"貴族侍從","speakerId":"avg_npc_496_1","isRemote":false,"text":"男爵他……沒能逃掉。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"貴族侍從","speakerId":"avg_npc_496_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唉，他早就想搬家了。要不是最近總能聽到一個薩科塔在附近拉琴，他開始捨不得走，我們又怎麼會趕上這些倒楣事！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"費德里科","speakerId":"avg_1032_excu2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那是什麼樣的琴聲？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"貴族侍從","speakerId":"avg_npc_496_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你要聽嗎？男爵都讓我錄下來了，也不知道留聲機有沒有被那幫人弄壞……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"米夏","speakerId":"avg_4109_baslin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你還真找到了線索。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"費德里科","speakerId":"avg_1032_excu2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是洛里斯·博爾丁找到的。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"費德里科","speakerId":"avg_1032_excu2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"米夏","speakerId":"avg_4109_baslin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是阿爾圖羅的演奏嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"費德里科","speakerId":"avg_1032_excu2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"沒錯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"費德里科","speakerId":"avg_1032_excu2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我的確聽不出一段相同的旋律是出自人還是雕塑，可我不可能錯認阿爾圖羅的琴聲。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"米夏","speakerId":"avg_4109_baslin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那我們豈不是身處危險之中？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"費德里科","speakerId":"avg_1032_excu2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不必擔心，錄音中並沒有源石技藝。她也不在附近。幾分鐘之前，有人在這條街道上同步播送了她的琴聲。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"米夏","speakerId":"avg_4109_baslin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"她的源石技藝生效範圍……這麼大？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"費德里科","speakerId":"avg_1032_excu2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"她一定有同伴在身側。只有你們萊塔尼亞人的法術和她的源石技藝共同作用，才可能有這種效果。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"米夏","speakerId":"avg_4109_baslin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你能聽出這麼多訊息？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"費德里科","speakerId":"avg_1032_excu2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這裡。這段聲響不是大提琴能發出來的。這是管風琴，而且大小超乎尋常。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"米夏","speakerId":"avg_4109_baslin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"巨型管風琴……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"費德里科","speakerId":"avg_1032_excu2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"聽起來很獨特。崔林特爾梅附近哪裡有類似樂器？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"米夏","speakerId":"avg_4109_baslin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……路德維格大學。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"費德里科","speakerId":"avg_1032_excu2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"一所學校？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"米夏","speakerId":"avg_4109_baslin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯。那裡原本是……烏提卡家族世代求學的高塔。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_black"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑鍵","speakerId":"avg_4046_ebnhlz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"頭痛。\n在逃離維謝海姆之後，他幾乎沒有再經歷過如此劇烈的疼痛。\n上一次痛得想要大喊大叫，想要嘔吐，想要淚流滿面……還是什麼時候？\n是……\n他記得的。他只是不願意回憶。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑鍵","speakerId":"avg_4046_ebnhlz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"為什麼……不開口說話？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑鍵","speakerId":"avg_4046_ebnhlz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你可以嘲笑我了。我把你在腦子裡關了這麼久，你終於要贏了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑鍵","speakerId":"avg_4046_ebnhlz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"等我死了以後……哈，我最好真能乾脆地死掉。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑鍵","speakerId":"avg_4046_ebnhlz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"像你這樣，明明死了這麼長時間，連屍骨都化了灰，還要被忠誠的僕人從碎片拼回來，拉回塵世……也太可笑了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"44_g4_towerroom"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"暴躁的老者","speakerId":"avg_npc_1114_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他在胡言亂語些什麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"暴躁的老者","speakerId":"avg_npc_1114_1","isRemote":false,"text":"格哈德，你的術式還沒啟動吧？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_1124_1","isRemote":false,"text":"沒有，老師。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_1124_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他看起來非常難受。他真的能熬過去嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"暴躁的老者","speakerId":"avg_npc_1114_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嘖，再怎麼說也是赫爾昏佐倫的血脈。這點苦都吃不下去，伊維格娜德是故意讓人把他養成了廢物吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_1124_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他還很年輕，卻已經吃了很多苦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_1124_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如果他承受不了術式，塵世之音的演奏中斷，“始源之角”的降臨可能會失控，整個路德維格都會受影響。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"暴躁的老者","speakerId":"avg_npc_1114_1","isRemote":false,"text":"有我在，高塔塌不了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_1124_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可是您答應過陛下，不能暴露您的力量。讓那麼多的學生得知您的身份，陛下就不得不對其他貴族有所交代。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_1124_1","isRemote":false,"text":"到時候，路德維格大學可能會被迫關停，您接下來的搬遷計劃也會有阻礙。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_1124_1","isRemote":false,"text":"等小埃米送完信回到萊塔尼亞，一定會唸叨您的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"暴躁的老者","speakerId":"avg_npc_1114_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……麻煩。要保這小子的命，真比喚回“始源之角”還難。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"暴躁的老者","speakerId":"avg_npc_1114_1","isRemote":false,"text":"萊辛呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_1124_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他去外面守著了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_1124_1","isRemote":false,"text":"萊辛說，他會確保在儀式結束前，他們進不來。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"暴躁的老者","speakerId":"avg_npc_1114_1","isRemote":false,"text":"算了，不就是要保住他的意識不被扯碎嗎？上次我做給玻利瓦爾那夥瘋子的法術裝置去哪了……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑鍵","speakerId":"avg_4046_ebnhlz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_1124_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你還好嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑鍵","speakerId":"avg_4046_ebnhlz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呵……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_1124_1","isRemote":false,"text":"沒事的。他們都暫時離開了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑鍵","speakerId":"avg_4046_ebnhlz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……你是……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格哈德","speakerId":"avg_npc_1124_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我們不久前剛見過面。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑鍵","speakerId":"avg_4046_ebnhlz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"密林……公園……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格哈德","speakerId":"avg_npc_1124_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是的。我本想提醒你，但萊辛也在。有他盯著，我沒辦法帶你走。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑鍵","speakerId":"avg_4046_ebnhlz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"萊辛……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格哈德","speakerId":"avg_npc_1124_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那孩子本性不壞，就是有些認死理。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格哈德","speakerId":"avg_npc_1124_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我以前也和他一樣……可人只要有勇氣，就能有所改變。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑鍵","speakerId":"avg_4046_ebnhlz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……嗯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格哈德","speakerId":"avg_npc_1124_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你還有力氣嗎？試試看，握緊我的手。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"暴躁的老者","speakerId":"avg_npc_1114_1","isRemote":false,"text":"格哈德，你在做什麼？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格哈德","speakerId":"avg_npc_1124_1","isRemote":false,"text":"抱歉，老師。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格哈德","speakerId":"avg_npc_1124_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我不能讓您這樣利用赫爾昏佐倫的血脈。他是個活生生的人，還能擁有輝煌的未來。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"暴躁的老者","speakerId":"avg_npc_1114_1","isRemote":false,"text":"空間防禦術式——該死，這還是我教你的！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格哈德","speakerId":"avg_npc_1124_1","isRemote":false,"text":"再強大的源石技藝都無法彌補遺憾……這也是您教我的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格哈德","speakerId":"avg_npc_1124_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我曾經用您教我的法術，傷害過很多人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格哈德","speakerId":"avg_npc_1124_1","isRemote":false,"text":"在午夜夢回的時刻，我常常責問自己——假如當初我沒有那麼做，那些本可以繼續閃耀的靈魂就不會在我手中消逝。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格哈德","speakerId":"avg_npc_1124_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那我們如今所處的這個時代，身邊的人，包括我們自身……是不是會變得更好？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格哈德","speakerId":"avg_npc_1124_1","isRemote":false,"text":"所以我才放棄了高塔術師的身份，成為一名學者。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"暴躁的老者","speakerId":"avg_npc_1114_1","isRemote":false,"text":"格哈德，你在說什麼胡話？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"暴躁的老者","speakerId":"avg_npc_1114_1","isRemote":false,"text":"把那小子留下，不要犯錯——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格哈德","speakerId":"avg_npc_1124_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……犯錯？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格哈德","speakerId":"avg_npc_1124_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不，老師。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格哈德","speakerId":"avg_npc_1124_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我要救他，正是因為，我不能再錯過這個機會。我要挽回我和您……我們犯過的最大的錯。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null}],"observedOperators":[]}
